graph TB
    %% icons: BAT=battery, PWR=zap, MCU=mcu, SENS=sensor, TEMP=thermometer
    %% icons: LCD=display, BUZZ=speaker, PUMP=fan, BTN=button, UI=layout, AIR=wind
    BAT[9V Battery] --> PWR[Power Management]
    PWR --> MCU[ARM Microcontroller]
    PWR --> SENS[Electrochemical Sensor]
    PWR --> UI[User Interface]
    PWR --> AIR[Air Sampling System]

    SENS -->|Analog Signal| MCU
    TEMP[Temperature Sensor] -->|I2C| MCU
    MCU -->|SPI| LCD[2" LCD Display]
    MCU -->|GPIO| BUZZ[Buzzer]
    MCU -->|PWM| PUMP[Air Pump]
    BTN[Power Button] -->|GPIO| MCU

    AIR --> SENS
    UI -.-> BTN
    UI -.-> LCD
    UI -.-> BUZZ
